{"unit_id":"ignotuss__dsh-desktop-bridge#card-zh","repo":"ignotuss/dsh-desktop-bridge","commit":"8b28926c09e609a2ff004527cf4976c5d6dbdb2d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Bridge 是面向 DSH 桌面端、Web 和 TUI 主机的会话控制插件。它在正在运行的 DSH 主机中接入 sessionController，并提供仅绑定本机回环地址的 HTTP API 与命令行客户端。外部本机程序可以列出会话、读取最近事件、向现有会话发送消息，也可以为已存在的工作目录创建会话并设置标题。创建权限、审计日志和工作目录允许列表可通过配置调整，插件挂载时发布连接描述文件，卸载时关闭监听并清理该文件。适合希望从脚本或其他本地程序自动化管理 DSH 会话的用户；需要可用的 DSH 主机和 sessionController，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:7-8","src/index.js:146-239","src/index.js:274-316","bin/bridge-client.mjs:46-65"]}
{"unit_id":"ignotuss__dsh-desktop-bridge#card-en","repo":"ignotuss/dsh-desktop-bridge","commit":"8b28926c09e609a2ff004527cf4976c5d6dbdb2d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Desktop Bridge exposes a running DSH host's sessionController through a local HTTP API and CLI. List sessions, read events, send messages, or create sessions. Optional settings control creation and request logs. Requires a compatible DSH host; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:7-8","src/index.js:146-239","src/index.js:274-316","bin/bridge-client.mjs:46-65"]}
