{"unit_id":"ignotuss__dsh-desktop-bridge#feature-1","repo":"ignotuss/dsh-desktop-bridge","commit":"8b28926c09e609a2ff004527cf4976c5d6dbdb2d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Bridge 的功能「会话列表」：通过 GET /v1/sessions 获取正在运行主机的会话列表，调用 sessionController.list 并返回 items。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:192-197"]}
